{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2022-12-07 17:00:00', 'title': 'UNITED RENTALS COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF AHERN RENTALS', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--UNITED RENTALS, INC. (NYSE: URI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF THE ASSETS OF AHERN RENTALS, INC. FOR APPROXIMATELY $2.0 BILLION IN CASH. THE TRANSACTION AND RELATED EXPENSES WERE FUNDED THROUGH A COMBINATION OF NEWLY ISSUED SENIOR SECURED NOTES AND EXISTING CAPACITY UNDER THE COMPANY'S ABL FACILITY."}